格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A DeepSeek Harness Web plugin that puts a dynamic little buddy — a GrokBot-style animated avatar with a synchronized typewriter status line — right in front of the \"Deep diving...\" indicator. 在「Deep diving...」状态提示前，放一只动态小伙伴——GrokBot 风格动画头像，状态文字还会同步打字机变换。","id":"gh:1334820342","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-thought-buddy","slug":"dsh-plugins/dsh-thought-buddy","topics":["buddy","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","grokbot"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness Web plugin that puts a dynamic little buddy — a GrokBot-style animated avatar wit"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"h a synchronized typewriter status line — right in front of the \"Deep diving...\" indicator. 在「Deep d"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"iving...」状态提示前，放一只动态小伙伴——GrokBot 风格动画头像，状态文字还会同步打字机变换。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-thought-buddy"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**A DeepSeek Harness Web plugin that puts a dynamic little buddy — a GrokBot-style animated avatar w"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ith a synchronized typewriter status line — right in front of the \"Deep diving...\" indicator.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`dsh-thought-buddy` is a Web plugin with profile-backed configuration for the DeepSeek Harness Web G"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"UI. While the model is working, the status pill that reads `Deep diving...` grows a tiny Grok-style "},{"id":"p5s3","text":"robot avatar: it blinks, swaps expressions with a springy morph, wanders its gaze, and gently bobs —"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" all drawn live as **SVG via `requestAnimationFrame`**, with no additional animation library. Every "},{"id":"p5s5","text":"time the avatar switches expression, the status text rewrites itself with a typewriter effect (delet"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"ing character by character, then typing out the next word)."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The avatar animation is ported from nasawz/GrokBot (a pure Flutter `CustomPaint` widget) to the web:"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" all 25 expressions × 2 eyes × 48-point eye rings, 18 body shapes, and 39 states with their expressi"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"on/blink cadences are preserved."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Feature | Description |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| GrokBot avatar | thinking-state expression pool `[8,16,14,17,5]` cycles automatically; springy mor"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ph between expressions; 320 ms blinks (random 3.5–7 s interval); spherical head-turn projection + wa"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"ndering gaze; gentle 1.7 s breathing bob |\n| Expression-synced typewriter | on every expression swit"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"ch, the status text leaves `Deep diving...` via a typewriter effect (delete character by character, "},{"id":"p9s5","text":"pause, then type out the next word) cycling through 55 candidates (`Accomplishing`…`Working`), e.g. "},{"id":"p9s6","text":"`Reticulating...`; React re-renders never overwrite it (the text fiber's children string never chang"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"es, so React bails out) |\n| Emoji mode | fallback mode that cycles an emoji list (default `🤿 🫧 🌊 🐙 🔍"},{"id":"p9s8","text":" 🧠 💭`) with a pop-in on every switch |\n| Theme aware | follows `prefers-color-scheme`: light `#5b7fe"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"5/#fffdf7`, dark `#6689ea/#181a15` (matching the DSH theme) |\n| Reduced motion | under `prefers-redu"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"ced-motion: reduce`, the bob and head-turn sway are disabled; expression changes and blinks remain |"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"\n| Self-cleaning | the animation stops as soon as the status pill leaves the DOM; inserted nodes sur"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"vive React re-renders and are re-asserted on the next mutation if ever removed |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Copy the block below and paste it to your DSH agent (the assistant in this web\nGUI). The agent perfo"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"rms the install and verification for you — no manual npm\nor profile editing needed:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Then restart `dsh web`, refresh the page, and send the model a message — the buddy appears in front "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"of `Deep diving...`. Runtime preferences use the loader-managed configuration form and apply immedia"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"eep diving...`. Runtime preferences use the loader-managed configuration form and apply immediately."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### Install from a local checkout (`link:`)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"For local development, wire the plugin into a web profile via a `link:` dependency (example: `C:\\Use"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"rs\\Administrator\\.dsh\\profiles\\web`):"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"1. Build the artifacts: `npm run build` → compiles TypeScript and produces `lib/client.js` + `lib/in"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"dex.js`\n2. In the profile, run `pnpm install` (works offline)\n3. **Restart `dsh web`** — the client-"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"module manifest is composed at boot, so a new bundle needs a restart\n4. Refresh the page and send th"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"s composed at boot, so a new bundle needs a restart\n4. Refresh the page and send the model a message"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 2.0.0 configuration and migration"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Requires Node.js 24.9+ and dsh-loader 2.x. Supports the loader's explicit `0.1.5`, `0.1.6`, `0.1.7`,"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" `0.2.0`, `0.2.1` and `0.2.2` release families, including prereleases."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Loader's config-api stores preferences at `<profile>/config/dsh-thought-buddy/config.json`. Before `"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"0.1.6-alpha.2`, open **Settings → Plugin configuration**; from that version, use the plugin detail p"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"age. The card starts collapsed. Saving immediately refreshes the animation. Reset changes the draft "},{"id":"p20s4","text":"d starts collapsed. Saving immediately refreshes the animation. Reset changes the draft until saved."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Field | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| `enabled` | `true` | Show the buddy |\n| `mode` | `avatar` | Animated `avatar` or cycling `emoji` |"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"\n| `size` | `18` | Size, 8–64 px |\n| `emojis` | `🤿 🫧 🌊 🐙 🔍 🧠 💭` | Nonempty array of emoji strings |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"1.x localStorage keys are no longer read or imported automatically. Re-enter old preferences in the "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"form. Each profile has its own configuration; uninstalling retains the file. Unload cancels the subs"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"cription and animation, including configuration reads that complete later."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Development and architecture"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The host entry registers a config-api template. The client reads and subscribes to preferences, moun"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ts the SVG/typewriter with `dshLoaderUi.mount`, and cleans up on update or unload."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"`src/config.ts` contains browser-safe defaults and types; `src/config-template.ts` is host-only. tsd"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"own bundles client ESM into a `__ModuleLoader__.load` factory. The client declares the `dshLoaderUi`"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" service dependency; package metadata declares the loader client module dependency."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"`test/verify.mjs` checks the built bundle's SVG, animation cadence, typewriter, live configuration c"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"hanges and unload during an asynchronous read. The original geometry and animation engine are retain"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ges and unload during an asynchronous read. The original geometry and animation engine are retained."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Links"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- Repository: https://github.com/dsh-plugins/dsh-thought-buddy\n- npm: https://www.npmjs.com/package/"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"@dsh-plugin/dsh-thought-buddy"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"BSD-3-Clause. The eye-ring geometry, body shapes, and state cadences derive from nasawz/GrokBot (BSD"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2026 nasawz), credited in the LICENSE file."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
